<title>SWITZERLAND: Geneva July inflation falls to 0.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Geneva July inflation falls to 0.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer prices fell 0.1 percent in July from June for a year-on-year inflation rate of 0.4 percent, the city's statistics office said.</p>
<p>				   July 1997     June 1997     July 1996</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index change   -0.1 pct	+0.1 pct     -0.1  pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr inflation		+0.4 pct	+0.5 pct     +0.5  pct</p>
<p> Index (May 1993 = 100)	  104.3	   104.4	   103.8</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
